{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1stgifnew-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751208362\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Light Dude</strong> the level goes dark when you move so that every obstacle in the level gets hidden! Once you stop moving, the level reveals again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/outoflightnew-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751208362\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Careful!</strong> You\u2019ve only got a handful of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety</strong> \u2013 Chapters with different puzzles, obstacles and boss fights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Humor</strong> \u2013 Lots of laughs as the game roasts you when you lose!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Replay Light Dude with no restarts, speed runs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play it your style\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Full Keyboard &amp; Controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/gif2bossthenskullsgreen_optimize35perc.gif?t=1751208362\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1751208362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/358321a176ee584f9